---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Show or rebuild the account-level user voice profile

Usage: mxr voice [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  show     Show the profile (default if omitted)
  rebuild  Rebuild the profile from outbound mail
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
